SM8450 module load lists and blocklists used to stage the vendor_boot,
vendor_dlkm and system_dlkm kernel modules. They match the
BOARD_*_KERNEL_MODULES_LOAD and BOARD_*_KERNEL_MODULES_BLOCKLIST_FILE lists
of the device tree:

  https://github.com/cupid-development/android_device_xiaomi_sm8450-common
  branch lineage-24.0-6.6, commit a04c4bfd962e80dd197ae81b1e2fcbbffa8587c5

Keep them in sync with the modules built from this tree: a module listed
here but no longer built fails the image packing, and a new vendor module
is installed to vendor_dlkm but only loaded at boot once it is listed in
modules.load (or modules.load.vendor_boot for first stage).
